<title>USA: Echo Bay sets Quest Intl Honduras venture.</title>
<headline>Echo Bay sets Quest Intl Honduras venture.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quest International Resources Corp said Echo Bay Mines Ltd has agreed in principle to an earn-in and mining venture agreement wherein Echo Bay may earn a 60 percent interest in Quest's Zopilote property in Honduras by spending $5.4 million over 4 years.</p>
<p>Echo Bay may acquire an additional 10 percent interest within 90 days after the earn-in for $3 million. Quest would then retain a 30 percent interest, it said.</p>
<p>This funding will enable further development of the Zopilote property, Quest explained.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
